{"title":"Beyond Chatbots: The AI Agent That Follows Up on Every Lead (Virtual)","startsAt":"2026-10-14T17:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-14T18:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Every business has the same quiet leak: leads come in, and the busy ones slip through before you get back to them — and they call someone else.\n\nIn this session I'll show the whole journey live, on a real phone: a missed call triggers an instant text-back with a booking link, the lead books straight into the calendar, and the agent asks a few qualifying questions so you walk into the call prepared. We'll show you what's genuinely possible now, where it fits a real business, and what it would take to put it to work in yours.\n\nWe'll be using different tools including CRM, Excel, Claude Code & Cowork for demo purpose. You'll see how these tools figure things out for you and go beyond chatbots and conversation-based interaction. Essentially, you'll be building your own autonomous agent.\n\nWanna know more? Contact the host!","venue":{"name":"Online- Virtual Classes","address":"Online, Toronto","lat":43.64786,"lng":-79.39291,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"AI & Business Group","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/8/6/6/c/highres_535234412.jpeg"}